# MySweetPea dashboard — static-asset response headers.
#
# These apply ONLY to asset-layer responses (the SPA shell, fonts, icons,
# videos). Worker-generated responses (/api/*, /auth/*) carry their own
# security headers from src/index.ts — the _headers file never applies to them
# (documented Cloudflare behavior).
#
# Mirrors the exact header set the Worker used to attach to every response.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains

# Fingerprinted/static art: long-lived caching (same list the Worker used:
# woff2|svg|png|webp). Everything else keeps the assets default
# (public, max-age=0, must-revalidate + ETag).
/*.woff2
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*.webp
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# workers.dev lane: don't get indexed
https://:version.:subdomain.workers.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
